  skilDesc: "\"\u2022 H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng: D\u1ECBch chuy\u1EC3n t\u1EE9c th\u1EDDi
    v\xE0 t\xE0ng h\xECnh trong 4 gi\xE2y, \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i t\xE0n \u1EA3nh
    v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u0169, khi\xEAu kh\xEDch k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch nh\xECn v\xE0o
    n\xF3 trong 4 gi\xE2y.\n\n\u2022 Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng: T\u1EA1i t\xE0n \u1EA3nh
    xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n qu\u1EA3 c\u1EA7u ph\xE9p. Sau 1s qu\u1EA3 c\u1EA7u n\u1ED5
    g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0 cho\xE1ng, c\u01B0\u1EDDng h\xF3a 3 \u0111\xF2n
    \u0111\xE1nh th\u01B0\u1EDDng ti\u1EBFp theo, g\xE2y th\xEAm s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    ph\xE9p\n\n\u2022 Design: C\xF4ng c\u1EE5 th\u1EA3 di\u1EC1u (Kite) v\xE0 \u0111\xE1nh
    l\u1EEBa AI qu\xE1i ho\xE0n h\u1EA3o.\""
